## What I Learned
How to use grep to search for specific patterns inside 
files. Grep is one of the most useful command line tools 
in security work — used for searching log files for 
suspicious activity, finding specific strings in code, 
and filtering output from other commands. Combined with 
pipes it becomes even more powerful as demonstrated in 
the Plumbing challenge.
